{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"REJECT\n### VERIFICATION EVIDENCE\n- `uv run pytest -q`: 13 passed.\n- Disposable `test/Reaper Project` copy with `uv run vgt analyze`: wrote schema v2 skeleton, hashes, and provenance.\n- `luac -p reascript/vgt_initialize.lua`: passed.\n- Reproduced Phase 0 re-apply round-trip with a legal source path containing `}`: generated sidecar fails `json.load` with `JSONDecodeError`.\n\n### VERDICT REASON\n`read_analysis_block()` counts `{`/`}` without respecting JSON strings. Since provenance stores an absolute source path, a valid project/audio path containing `}` causes Phase 0 apply to write malformed JSON and corrupt the v2 sidecar. Replace this ad-hoc extraction with JSON-aware parsing or a string/escape-aware scanner, and add a regression test covering braces in string values."}}
